{
"file": 1148,
"paths": [
"d009/d035/f051"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "6d6f16d8",
"en_raw": "Why must I"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "8849df14",
"en_raw": "be hurt like this?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "ef8d74e6",
"en_raw": "Can you say for sure"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "f2176c85",
"en_raw": "she has talent!?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "633e879c",
"en_raw": "Art isn't the only"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "7c8821e3",
"en_raw": "value, you know"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "ae7d55a2",
"en_raw": "If we decide that"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "f3c092fc",
"en_raw": "it's no different from school"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "f300c381",
"en_raw": "Then what should I"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "89687b10",
"en_raw": "expect from her?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "9db20c71",
"en_raw": "Parents shouldn't expect"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "35f35c4f",
"en_raw": "Then what should I do"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "f0639ac8",
"en_raw": "what do I do..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "5adfdb3e",
"en_raw": "Let's wait patiently"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "c985d547",
"en_raw": "We're both tired today..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "d181bf64",
"en_raw": "Why do you care?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "f1b90412",
"en_raw": "Teachers are"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "cf2a57c8",
"en_raw": "just salarymen after all"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "5fd26888",
"en_raw": "Even though they preach individuality"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "cae9749c",
"en_raw": "it's within their own value standards"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "2a3acabf",
"en_raw": "But we're different"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "f25ef4b9",
"en_raw": "We're parents"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "921233d5",
"en_raw": "Kurumi, the most..."
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "d5cd1225",
"en_raw": "I don't understand"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "ddf47bfe",
"en_raw": "that child at all!"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "b234459c",
"en_raw": "What is this value you talk about?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "8242bf89",
"en_raw": "Music, picture books?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "60f4fcf7",
"en_raw": "I never said anything to Takehiko"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "891f8a5d",
"en_raw": "I want to believe Kurumi and Kouichi"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "810f5692",
"en_raw": "are equally precious!"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "ee61d734",
"en_raw": "...That's all it is!"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "955b1d34",
"en_raw": "Fine"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "354cfab3",
"en_raw": "Let's contact Dr. Akigawa"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "52696b31",
"en_raw": "But what he says"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "6241f1c4",
"en_raw": "isn't wrong"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "f0390531",
"en_raw": "Masayo, why don't we"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "d0ece47c",
"en_raw": "think it over once more?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "79781f79",
"en_raw": "Takehiko can't"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "68c7b1e1",
"en_raw": "feel a parent's heart"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "58cbb392",
"en_raw": "His words are certainly"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "9b305dda",
"en_raw": "too idealistic"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "d9de140f",
"en_raw": "But should we change Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "eefa581f",
"en_raw": "even at risk of the worst?"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "f844e331",
"en_raw": "Is that the path"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "01d5cb4f",
"en_raw": "a parent should take?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "7f9dd70c",
"en_raw": "I'm afraid"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "be1127da",
"en_raw": "I'll lose the ability to give love!"
}
]
}